          "id": "10362",
          "body": "**Changes made:** \n\n| **Metadata Name** | **Metadata Type** | **Action** | **Notes** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Account_Scheduled_Player_Set_Inactive | Flow | New Component |\n\n| Account | CustomObject | Update Component | Enable Account Field History |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Account.Player_Status__c | CustomField | Update Component | Enable Field History |\n\n**Testing:** Validated in sandbox via flow debug. To simulate the 90-day inactivity scenario within the test data's timeframe, the inactivity threshold on Account_Scheduled_Player_Set_Inactive was temporarily changed to 1 day. Debug run confirms Active Players with a Last Activity Date older than the threshold correctly flip to Inactive with Player_Status_Reason__c = Inactivity. Threshold to be reverted to 90 days before this is considered final.\n\n**Scenario 2:** Activated the scheduled flow with `InactivityThresholdDays` set to 2 days. ",
